(text "5.1V CORE comes from power J6. CM4 returns 3.3V only while powered.\nTPS2553 protects the display supply independently; output fault is read by GPIO22.\nJ5 mates to the supplied 3-position display power cable: 5V / unused / GND." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 0290c9dc-3d7f-4f27-91eb-e4ada230f8e8))
